<title>ESTONIA: TALLINNA TO SET UP TALSE INDEX FUND.</title>
<headline>TALLINNA TO SET UP TALSE INDEX FUND.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tallinna Pank has applied for a licence to set up a fund based on the Tallinn stock exchange index (TALSE), newspaper Aripaev said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The newspaper quoted Tallinna Pank's deputy chairman Targo Raus as saying that the fund will not start immediately after registration as existing law will not yet allow it.</p>
<p>Representatives of the stock exchange said that the licence could take at least a month to be approved, the newspaper added.</p>
<p>-- David Mardiste, Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
